      "before_answer": "According to [Source 1](faqs.csv | ?) and [Source 2](policies.md | 2. Returns, Replacements & Refunds Policy), Nexora offers a **30-Day Return Policy**. To qualify for a full refund, the product must be returned within 30 days of the original purchase date, in **unused and like-new condition**, and in its **original packaging**. An RMA (Return Merchandise Authorization) number must be obtained from customer support before shipping the return. \n\nWould you like to initiate a return or have any further questions about the process?",
